%% ChinaLowCost editable Mermaid source — each block is a separate diagram.
%% ORDER
stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> DRAFT
 DRAFT --> SUBMITTED: customer confirms
 SUBMITTED --> AVAILABILITY_CONFIRMED: staff verifies stock and final total
 AVAILABILITY_CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED: verified payment or approved COD
 AVAILABILITY_CONFIRMED --> EXPIRED: reservation/payment window ends
 SUBMITTED --> EXPIRED: confirmation window ends
 CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED: all quantities resolved and required reconciliation complete
 SUBMITTED --> CANCELLATION_REQUESTED
 AVAILABILITY_CONFIRMED --> CANCELLATION_REQUESTED
 CONFIRMED --> CANCELLATION_REQUESTED
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> CANCELED: review approved; refund tracked separately
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> CONFIRMED: denied if prior state was confirmed
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> SUBMITTED: denied if prior state was submitted
 CANCELLATION_REQUESTED --> AVAILABILITY_CONFIRMED: denied if prior state was availability confirmed

%% PAYMENT ATTEMPT — render as separate diagram
stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> CREATED
 CREATED --> PENDING
 PENDING --> SUCCEEDED: verified provider event
 PENDING --> FAILED: verified failure
 PENDING --> EXPIRED: verified expiry
 EXPIRED --> SUCCEEDED: late verified settlement; exception review

%% SHIPMENT — render as separate diagram
stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> PLANNED
 PLANNED --> READY_FOR_DISPATCH
 READY_FOR_DISPATCH --> DISPATCHED
 DISPATCHED --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
 OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED: authorized proof
 OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERY_FAILED
 DELIVERY_FAILED --> RESCHEDULED
 RESCHEDULED --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
 DELIVERY_FAILED --> RETURN_TO_BASE
 RETURN_TO_BASE --> RECEIVED_BACK
 DISPATCHED --> LOST
 OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> LOST

%% REFUND — render as separate diagram
stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> REQUESTED
 REQUESTED --> APPROVED: independent finance approval
 REQUESTED --> REJECTED
 APPROVED --> SUBMITTED: reserve amount; idempotent request
 SUBMITTED --> SUCCEEDED: verified settlement
 SUBMITTED --> FAILED: verified failure
 SUBMITTED --> MANUAL_REVIEW: uncertain result
 FAILED --> SUBMITTED: authorized retry
 MANUAL_REVIEW --> SUCCEEDED: reconciled settlement
 MANUAL_REVIEW --> FAILED: reconciled failure
